    <h1>eidetic-daemon <em>docs</em></h1>
    <p class="subhead">
      Local-first Go daemon that captures every Claude Code, Cursor, and Cowork
      session into a single SQLite-WAL engram store, and serves it back in
      &lt;100ms P95. 278,561 engrams. 803 sessions. 3.3 GB. Two weeks of real
      dogfood. Free and MIT.
    </p>
